		(property "DesignNotes" "XH 2-circuit top-entry without boss, pitch2.50mm, body7.4x5.75mm, height7mm; manufacturer 2-circuit hole1.00 +/-0.05mm matches stock1.00mm drill. Pad1=NC sense, pad2=COM/GND. Mating XHP-2 housing and SXH-001T-P0.6 contacts for AWG28..22; cable/crimp tooling and retention still to qualify. Dry isolated contacts only, no12/24V. J905 is status only, not hardware emergency-stop."
