		(property "DesignNotes" "Dual100V Schottky: pins1/3 anodes toGND;pin2 cathode and metal tab toSW5. Both dice connected with symmetric short copper. 5V1A branch diode average~0.79A total. TO220 chosen for local availability and fault-current margin. Exact Vf/leakage/thermal limits must follow purchased manufacturer; benchmark per-die rating10A. Tab is switched voltage, notGND. Do not attach to grounded/shared bare heatsink."
