		(property "DesignNotes" "Pico2W removable: two 1x20 female sockets H8.5mm, pitch2.54mm, rows17.78mm, nominal drill1mm; require finished holes0.97..1.07mm. Add two male1x20 headers to bare module. Stock Pico W symbol/pinmap unchanged; preserve antenna window and keepout. 3D uses Pico W mechanical proxy with added headers, elevated8.5mm over two female sockets; NOT exact Pico2W component model. Socket drawing M20-78220xx body51.2x2.5mm. Verify actual module/socket/heatsink/enclosure before fabrication."
